" end="36.337">me</span> <span begin="36.337" end="37.379">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">男孩们从我身边走过</span></p><p begin="37.718" end="40.039" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.718" end="37.994">Talkin&apos;</span> <span begin="37.994" end="38.327">some</span> <span begin="38.327" end="38.647">shit</span> <span begin="38.647" end="38.794">with</span> <span begin="38.794" end="39.035">your</span> <span begin="39.035" end="39.180">hand</span> <span begin="39.180" end="39.340">on</span> <span begin="39.340" end="39.528">my</span> <span begin="39.528" end="40.039">ass</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满嘴轻浮 对我轻薄无礼</span></p><p begin="40.039" end="42.427" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.039" end="40.208">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="40.208" end="40.396">a</span> <span begin="40.396" end="40.929">murderer</span> <span begin="40.929" end="41.262">in</span> <span begin="41.262" end="42.427">disguise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伪装之下 我是致命猎手</span></p><p begin="42.481" end="45.046" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.481" end="42.697">Yeah,</span> <span begin="42.697" end="42.857">you</span> <span begin="42.857" end="43.139">wanna</span> <span begin="43.139" end="43.471">be</span> <span begin="43.471" end="43.791">cool,</span> <span begin="43.791" end="43.926">but</span> <span begin="43.926" end="44.139">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="44.139" end="44.419">makin&apos;</span> <span begin="44.419" end="44.604">me</span> <span begin="44.604" end="45.046">mad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 你想耍酷 但惹恼了我</span></p><p begin="45.046" end="47.510" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.046" end="45.241">Bite</span> <span begin="45.241" end="45.416">my</span> <span begin="45.416" end="45.721">lip,</span> <span begin="45.721" end="46.002">it</span> <span begin="46.002" end="46.388">starts</span> <span begin="46.388" end="46.589">to</span> <span begin="46.589" end="47.510">bleed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">咬住我的嘴唇 渐渐渗出血丝</span></p><p begin="47.585" end="50.131" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.585" end="47.722">Yeah,</span> <span begin="47.722" end="47.948">it</span> <span begin="47.948" end="48.215">tastes</span> <span begin="48.215" end="48.588">so</span> <span begin="48.588" end="48.883">good,</span> <span begin="48.883" end="49.043">but</span> <span begin="49.043" end="49.238">I</span> <span begin="49.238" end="49.543">gotta</span> <span begin="49.543" end="49.744">be</span> <span begin="49.744" end="50.131">bad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是的 这滋味很妙 但我定要放纵一场</span></p><p begin="50.230" end="51.655" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.230" end="50.395">If</span> <span begin="50.395" end="50.595">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="50.595" end="50.834">gonna</span> <span begin="50.834" end="50.981">get</span> <span begin="50.981" end="51.169">you</span> <span begin="51.169" end="51.655">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我带你回家</span></p></div><div begin="51.791" end="1:12.419" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="51.791" end="56.658" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.791" end="52.395">Gonna</span> <span begin="52.395" end="52.701">make</span> <span begin="52.701" end="53.035">the</span> <span begin="53.035" end="53.511">cur</span><span begin="53.703" end="54.196">tains</span> <span begin="54.369" end="54.981">cream,</span> <span begin="54.981" end="55.901">believe</span> <span begin="55.901" end="56.658">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">定会掀起一场风雨 信不信由你</span></p><p begin="56.850" end="1:01.997" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.850" end="57.331">Gonna</span> <span begin="57.331" end="57.839">make</span> <span begin="57.839" end="58.146">the</span> <span begin="58.146" end="58.677">cei</span><span begin="58.775" end="59.322">ling</span> <span begin="59